<title>USA: Mycogen names new chairman.</title>
<headline>Mycogen names new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mycogen Corp said Friday that its Chairman and Chief Executive Jerry Caulder will step away from day-to-day management &quot;as part of a planned transition in leadership.&quot;</p>
<p>He will remain on the board, the company said.</p>
<p>Mycogen said it elected Nickolas Hein chairman. He had been vice president for global growth for DowElanco.</p>
<p>The company said it placed President Carl Eibl in charge of the management team.</p>
</text>
